1
00:00:01,752 --> 00:00:04,296
OH... UH, HEY, RACH.

2
00:00:04,296 --> 00:00:05,464
UH, I WAS

3
00:00:05,464 --> 00:00:07,257
JUST COMING OVER HERE TO, UH...

4
00:00:08,801 --> 00:00:09,885
OH, WAIT.
I DON'T HAVE TO LIE TO YOU.

5
00:00:09,885 --> 00:00:11,178
YOU DON'T LIVE HERE ANYMORE.

6
00:00:11,178 --> 00:00:12,554
UH... I'M EATING THEIR FOOD.

7
00:00:12,554 --> 00:00:13,514
WHAT ARE YOU DOING?

8
00:00:14,974 --> 00:00:17,267
ROSS IS ON A DATE
WITH MY SISTER

9
00:00:17,267 --> 00:00:19,854
AND THEY SHUT THE DRAPES
TWO-AND-A-HALF HOURS AGO.

10
00:00:19,854 --> 00:00:22,606
WHOA. I DIDN'T KNOW
WE COULD DATE YOUR SISTER.

11
00:00:25,818 --> 00:00:28,195
JOEY, WE KNOW YOU
STEAL OUR FOOD.

12
00:00:29,446 --> 00:00:31,239
I'M GOOD.

13
00:00:31,239 --> 00:00:33,116
OH, ARE THE
DRAPES STILL
CLOSED, HONEY?

14
00:00:33,116 --> 00:00:35,118
YEAH, YOU KNOW WHO SHOULD HAVE
SHUT THEIR DRAPES

15
00:00:35,118 --> 00:00:36,954
IS THAT PERVERTED OLD COUPLE
TWO DOORS OVER.

16
00:00:36,954 --> 00:00:38,079
IS THAT A SWING?

17
00:00:38,079 --> 00:00:39,707
OH, DON'T EVEN ASK.

18
00:00:39,707 --> 00:00:41,333
YECCH!

19
00:00:43,251 --> 00:00:44,670
I CAN'T BELIEVE ROSS
IS GOING OUT

20
00:00:44,670 --> 00:00:46,005
WITH RACHEL'S SISTER.

21
00:00:46,005 --> 00:00:47,715
WHEN CHANDLER MADE OUT
WITH MY SISTER

22
00:00:47,715 --> 00:00:49,174
I WAS MAD AT HIM
FOR TEN YEARS.

23
00:00:49,174 --> 00:00:51,134
THAT WAS, LIKE,
FIVE YEARS AGO.

24
00:00:51,134 --> 00:00:53,178
YEAH, YOU GOT FIVE YEARS LEFT.

25
00:00:53,178 --> 00:00:54,304
JOEY...

26
00:00:54,304 --> 00:00:55,347
YOU WANT TO MAKE IT SIX?!

27
00:01:02,646 --> 00:01:07,526
♪ SO NO ONE TOLD YOU
LIFE WAS GONNA BE THIS WAY ♪

28
00:01:07,526 --> 00:01:09,737
♪ YOUR JOB'S A JOKE,
YOU'RE BROKE ♪

29
00:01:09,737 --> 00:01:13,032
♪ YOUR LOVE LIFE'S D.O.A. ♪

30
00:01:13,032 --> 00:01:17,036
♪ IT'S LIKE YOU'RE ALWAYS
STUCK IN SECOND GEAR ♪

31
00:01:17,036 --> 00:01:19,246
♪ WHEN IT HASN'T BEEN
YOUR DAY, YOUR WEEK ♪

32
00:01:19,246 --> 00:01:22,583
♪ YOUR MONTH,
OR EVEN YOUR YEAR ♪

33
00:01:22,583 --> 00:01:25,794
♪ BUT I'LL BE THERE FOR YOU ♪

34
00:01:25,794 --> 00:01:31,633
♪ 'CAUSE YOU'RE THERE
FOR ME, TOO. ♪

35
00:01:37,723 --> 00:01:39,391
OH, ROSS! HEY!
HI, HOW ARE YOU?

36
00:01:39,391 --> 00:01:41,685
THERE YOU ARE.
HEY.

37
00:01:41,685 --> 00:01:43,854
GIVE ME A CUP
OF COFFEE.

38
00:01:45,689 --> 00:01:49,317
SO HOW WAS YOUR
BIG DATE LAST NIGHT?

39
00:01:49,317 --> 00:01:50,861
UH, IT WAS OKAY.

40
00:01:50,861 --> 00:01:51,862
IT WAS FUN.

41
00:01:51,862 --> 00:01:53,154
YEAH? IT WAS FUN?
MMM.

42
00:01:53,154 --> 00:01:56,283
GREAT.

43
00:01:56,283 --> 00:01:57,451
SO, UH...

44
00:01:57,451 --> 00:01:59,703
SO, DID YOU GUYS
HIT IT OFF?

45
00:02:01,622 --> 00:02:02,790
I GUESS SO.

46
00:02:02,790 --> 00:02:05,166
SO, D-DID
ANYTHING HAPPEN?

47
00:02:05,166 --> 00:02:07,962
BECAUSE RUMOR HAS IT
YOU GUYS SHUT THE DRAPES.

48
00:02:07,962 --> 00:02:10,965
NO, NO.
NOTHING HAPPENED.

49
00:02:10,965 --> 00:02:12,967
I SHUT THE DRAPES
TO SHOW HER SLIDES

50
00:02:12,967 --> 00:02:14,593
OF MY FAVORITE FOSSILS.

51
00:02:16,971 --> 00:02:20,223
OH, SLIDES!

52
00:02:20,223 --> 00:02:23,102
( chuckling):
SO REALLY NOTHING HAPPENED.

53
00:02:23,102 --> 00:02:26,730
WELL... SOMETHING COULD HAVE
HAPPENED, ALL RIGHT?

54
00:02:26,730 --> 00:02:28,649
SHE REALLY DUG MY SLIDES

55
00:02:28,649 --> 00:02:31,735
AND SHE WAS DEFINITELY
GIVING ME THE VIBE.

56
00:02:31,735 --> 00:02:34,571
WAS IT THE "PLEASE DON'T SHOW ME
ANOTHER PICTURE

57
00:02:34,571 --> 00:02:36,657
OF A TRILOBITE" VIBE?

58
00:02:36,657 --> 00:02:38,826
ANYWAY...

59
00:02:38,826 --> 00:02:40,160
IF SHE WASN'T INTO ME

60
00:02:40,160 --> 00:02:42,287
WHY-WHY WOULD SHE
ASK ME OUT AGAIN?

61
00:02:42,287 --> 00:02:43,664
SHE ASKED YOU OUT AGAIN?

62
00:02:43,664 --> 00:02:45,624
YEAH. UH-HUH.

63
00:02:45,624 --> 00:02:46,625
TOMORROW NIGHT.

64
00:02:46,625 --> 00:02:47,626
MMM.

65
00:02:47,626 --> 00:02:48,919
VALENTINE'S DAY.

66
00:02:48,919 --> 00:02:51,379
THE MOST ROMANTIC
DAY OF THE YEAR.

67
00:02:51,379 --> 00:02:53,757
WHO KNOWS WHAT COULD HAPPEN.

68
00:02:53,757 --> 00:02:57,176
I MIGHT NOT BE SHUTTING
MY DRAPES TO SHOW HER MY SLIDES,
IF YOU KNOW WHAT I MEAN.

69
00:02:57,176 --> 00:03:00,430
OKAY, OKAY, OKAY, OKAY!
I GOT IT, I GOT IT.
I CAN'T, I CAN'T, I CAN'T--

70
00:03:00,430 --> 00:03:02,432
I'M NOT GOOD WITH THE
YOU-AND-MY-SISTER THING, OKAY?
I JUST CAN'T.

71
00:03:02,432 --> 00:03:03,725
IT'S JUST TOO WEIRD,
ALL RIGHT?

72
00:03:03,725 --> 00:03:04,852
I IMAGINE THE TWO
OF YOU TOGETHER.

73
00:03:04,852 --> 00:03:06,895
I JUST FREAK OUT!
OKAY...

74
00:03:06,895 --> 00:03:09,023
IT FREAKS ME OUT
AND I CAN'T DO IT.
NO, NO, IT'S OKAY.

75
00:03:11,399 --> 00:03:12,651
IT'S OKAY.

76
00:03:14,987 --> 00:03:17,156
HEY, IT'S TOO WEIRD
FOR YOU.

77
00:03:17,156 --> 00:03:19,491
I WON'T SEE HER AGAIN.
THANK YOU. I... YEAH.

78
00:03:19,491 --> 00:03:22,201
I MEAN, AFTER TOMORROW NIGHT.
NO-NO-NO! NO-NO-NO!

79
00:03:22,201 --> 00:03:24,203
PLEASE, ROSS, I CAN'T,
I CAN'T DO ANYTHING.

80
00:03:24,203 --> 00:03:25,372
IT'S GOING TO FREAK
ME OUT!

81
00:03:25,372 --> 00:03:27,624
OKAY, OKAY... OKAY.

82
00:03:27,624 --> 00:03:31,670
I'LL TELL HER TONIGHT
I CAN'T SEE HER ANYMORE.

83
00:03:31,670 --> 00:03:34,213
( sobbing ):
OH, THANKS.

84
00:03:34,213 --> 00:03:36,424
YOU WANT ME TO CALL HER
RIGHT NOW?

85
00:03:36,424 --> 00:03:37,425
OH, NO!

86
00:03:37,425 --> 00:03:38,426
NO, NO, NO, NO, NO.

87
00:03:38,426 --> 00:03:40,554
NO. I MEAN, COME ON.

88
00:03:40,554 --> 00:03:42,723
THAT'S CRAZ...
I MEAN, THAT'S CRAZY.

89
00:03:42,723 --> 00:03:44,141
UH-HUH.

90
00:03:44,141 --> 00:03:45,600
SO WHAT'S GOING ON
WITH YOU?

91
00:03:45,600 --> 00:03:47,728
WHAT IS GOING ON
WITH YOU?

92
00:03:47,728 --> 00:03:49,396
WELL, UM...

93
00:03:49,396 --> 00:03:52,357
OH! I MAY BE TEACHING
ANOTHER CLASS THIS SEMESTER.

94
00:03:52,357 --> 00:03:54,193
YEAH, DO IT NOW.
CALL HER RIGHT NOW.

95
00:03:59,114 --> 00:04:00,407
( sobbing ):
THIS IS MY FAVORITE PART.

96
00:04:00,407 --> 00:04:01,575
YEAH, ME, TOO.

97
00:04:03,827 --> 00:04:07,706
OH, YOU KNOW WHAT'S
SADDER THAN THIS? BAMBI.

98
00:04:07,706 --> 00:04:09,541
I CRIED FOR THREE DAYS
WITH THAT MOVIE.

99
00:04:09,541 --> 00:04:11,250
NO, WAIT-- TWO.

100
00:04:11,250 --> 00:04:13,294
'CAUSE ON THE THIRD DAY,
MY MOTHER KILLED HERSELF

101
00:04:13,294 --> 00:04:14,671
SO I WAS PARTLY
CRYING FOR THAT.

102
00:04:16,048 --> 00:04:19,467
WELL, SEE, NOW, THAT,
I CAN SEE CRYING OVER,

103
00:04:19,467 --> 00:04:21,428
BUT BAMBI IS A CARTOON.

104
00:04:21,428 --> 00:04:23,346
YOU DIDN'T CRY
WHEN BAMBI'S MOTHER DIED?

105
00:04:23,346 --> 00:04:24,723
YES, IT WAS VERY SAD

106
00:04:24,723 --> 00:04:27,559
WHEN THE GUY STOPPED
DRAWING THE DEER.

107
00:04:29,853 --> 00:04:31,772
CHANDLER, THERE'S NOTHING
WRONG WITH CRYING.

108
00:04:31,772 --> 00:04:34,024
YOU DON'T HAVE TO BE
SO MACHO ALL THE TIME.

109
00:04:34,024 --> 00:04:36,068
I'M NOT MACHO.

110
00:04:36,068 --> 00:04:38,403
YEAH, YOU'RE RIGHT.

111
00:04:38,403 --> 00:04:40,488
I DON'T KNOW WHAT
I WAS THINKING.

112
00:04:40,488 --> 00:04:42,699
NO, I GUESS I JUST NEVER
REALLY CRIED, YOU KNOW?

113
00:04:42,699 --> 00:04:44,826
I'M NOT A CRYING
KIND OF GUY.

114
00:04:44,826 --> 00:04:46,036
COME ON, MAN,
THERE'S GOT TO BE SOMETHING

115
00:04:46,036 --> 00:04:47,788
THAT GETS YOU CHOKED UP.

116
00:04:47,788 --> 00:04:49,831
LIKE, UH...

117
00:04:49,831 --> 00:04:52,500
UH, WHAT IF YOU SAW
A THREE-LEGGED PUPPY.

118
00:04:54,086 --> 00:04:56,337
I'D BE SAD, SURE...

119
00:04:56,337 --> 00:04:58,132
BUT I WOULDN'T CRY.

120
00:04:58,132 --> 00:05:03,553
OKAY, WHAT IF THE PUPPY
SAID, "HELP ME, CHANDLER.

121
00:05:03,553 --> 00:05:07,432
ALL THE OTHER PUPPIES
PICK ON ME."

122
00:05:07,432 --> 00:05:09,935
CRY? I JUST FOUND
A TALKING PUPPY.

123
00:05:09,935 --> 00:05:10,894
I'M RICH.

124
00:05:12,146 --> 00:05:14,606
OH... I'VE GOT IT.

125
00:05:14,606 --> 00:05:15,816
I HAVE GOT IT.

126
00:05:15,816 --> 00:05:17,985
PICTURES FROM
YOUR CHILDHOOD.

127
00:05:17,985 --> 00:05:21,488
THIS'LL GET YOU
GOING GOOD. OKAY...

128
00:05:21,488 --> 00:05:22,990
ALL RIGHT, WHAT'S
GOING ON THERE?

129
00:05:22,990 --> 00:05:25,242
AH, THAT'S PARENTS DAY,
FIRST GRADE.

130
00:05:25,242 --> 00:05:29,037
THAT'S ME WITH
THE JANITOR, MARTIN.

131
00:05:29,037 --> 00:05:30,330
WHERE ARE YOUR PARENTS?

132
00:05:30,330 --> 00:05:32,332
OH, THEY DIDN'T
WANT TO COME.

133
00:05:32,332 --> 00:05:34,501
OH, CHANDLER.
POOR THING.

134
00:05:34,501 --> 00:05:36,795
SO, THAT STORY
DOESN'T MAKE YOU CRY?

135
00:05:36,795 --> 00:05:38,505
NO! LOOK, I DON'T CRY.

136
00:05:38,505 --> 00:05:40,174
IT'S NOT A BIG DEAL,
OKAY?

137
00:05:40,174 --> 00:05:42,634
NO, IT'S NOT OKAY!

138
00:05:42,634 --> 00:05:44,594
( voice cracking ):
IT'S NOT OKAY AT ALL.

139
00:05:45,929 --> 00:05:47,181
YOU'RE DEAD INSIDE!

140
00:05:52,227 --> 00:05:53,270
EXCUSE ME.

141
00:05:53,270 --> 00:05:55,022
YEAH?
ARE YOU PHOEBE BUFFAY?

142
00:05:55,022 --> 00:05:56,023
YEAH.

143
00:05:56,023 --> 00:05:57,149
( gasps )

144
00:05:57,149 --> 00:05:58,399
CAN I GET YOUR AUTOGRAPH?

145
00:05:58,399 --> 00:05:59,526
I'M YOUR BIGGEST FAN.

146
00:05:59,526 --> 00:06:00,944
OH, YOU'RE MY BIGGEST FAN?

147
00:06:00,944 --> 00:06:02,445
I'VE ALWAYS WANTED
TO MEET YOU. HI.

148
00:06:02,445 --> 00:06:04,531
SURE. YEAH.

149
00:06:04,531 --> 00:06:05,532
WOW.

150
00:06:05,532 --> 00:06:06,908
WOW, THANKS A LOT.

151
00:06:06,908 --> 00:06:08,202
I JUST WANT TO SAY

152
00:06:08,202 --> 00:06:10,245
I THINK YOU'RE
REALLY TALENTED.

153
00:06:10,245 --> 00:06:11,496
YOU'RE JUST SAYING THAT

154
00:06:11,496 --> 00:06:12,998
'CAUSE YOU'RE
MY BIGGEST FAN.

155
00:06:14,499 --> 00:06:15,750
JOEY, LISTEN

156
00:06:15,750 --> 00:06:17,252
TAKE GOOD CARE
OF THAT GUY, OKAY?

157
00:06:17,252 --> 00:06:18,545
HE'S A FAN.

158
00:06:18,545 --> 00:06:20,379
OH.

159
00:06:20,379 --> 00:06:21,631
BYE.

160
00:06:22,883 --> 00:06:24,176
SO...

161
00:06:24,176 --> 00:06:27,137
YOU SAW ME
ON DAYS OF OUR LIVES, HUH?

162
00:06:27,137 --> 00:06:31,141
WANT ME TO DO A LITTLE
DR. DRAKE RAMORAY FOR YOU?

163
00:06:34,644 --> 00:06:37,147
I HAVE NO IDEA
WHAT YOU'RE TALKING ABOUT.

164
00:06:37,147 --> 00:06:40,275
BUT I JUST GOT
PHOEBE BUFFAY'S AUTOGRAPH.

165
00:06:40,275 --> 00:06:42,485
OH. YOUR PHOEBE'S FAN.

166
00:06:42,485 --> 00:06:44,654
OH, YEAH.
I'VE SEEN ALL HER MOVIES.

167
00:06:46,656 --> 00:06:48,033
MOVIES?

168
00:06:48,033 --> 00:06:51,410
THAT WAS PHOEBE BUFFAY,
THE PORN STAR.

169
00:06:54,998 --> 00:06:56,791
( chuckles )

170
00:06:56,791 --> 00:06:57,792
I DON'T THINK SO.

171
00:06:57,792 --> 00:06:59,044
NO, NO, IT WAS.

172
00:06:59,044 --> 00:07:01,755
SHE WAS IN
SEX TOY STORY II.

173
00:07:03,048 --> 00:07:06,260
LAWRENCE OF ALABIA.

174
00:07:06,260 --> 00:07:08,803
AND I GOT
HER AUTOGRAPH.

175
00:07:08,803 --> 00:07:10,389
THE GUYS
AT THE COMIC BOOK STORE

176
00:07:10,389 --> 00:07:12,515
AREN'T GOING
TO BELIEVE THIS.

177
00:07:14,851 --> 00:07:16,353
GUNTHER.

178
00:07:16,353 --> 00:07:18,146
HEY, DON'T LET THAT GUY
IN HERE ANYMORE.

179
00:07:18,146 --> 00:07:20,565
HE JUST SAID PHOEBE'S
A PORN STAR.

180
00:07:20,565 --> 00:07:22,859
WELL, I WOULDN'T
CALL HER A STAR

181
00:07:22,859 --> 00:07:25,445
BUT SHE'S REALLY GOOD.

182
00:07:25,445 --> 00:07:28,198
YOU SHOULD CHECK OUT
INSPECT HER GADGET.

183
00:07:33,370 --> 00:07:34,996
HEY.
HEY.

184
00:07:34,996 --> 00:07:36,497
YOU'LL NEVER BELIEVE
WHAT JUST HAPPENED.

185
00:07:36,497 --> 00:07:37,916
ROSS JUST TOTALLY
BLEW ME OFF

186
00:07:37,916 --> 00:07:39,376
AND HE DIDN'T EVEN
TELL ME WHY.

187
00:07:39,376 --> 00:07:41,378
AH, WELL.

188
00:07:41,378 --> 00:07:42,587
YOU KNOW WHAT, HONEY?

189
00:07:42,587 --> 00:07:44,631
THE BEST THING TO DO
TO GET OVER A GUY

190
00:07:44,631 --> 00:07:46,133
IS TO START DATING
SOMEONE ELSE.

191
00:07:46,133 --> 00:07:49,052
OH! OH, THERE IS
THIS GREAT GUY

192
00:07:49,052 --> 00:07:50,887
YOU WILL JUST LOVE
AT WORK NAMED BOB.

193
00:07:50,887 --> 00:07:53,681
HE'S A REAL UP-AND-COMER
IN HUMAN RESOURCES.

194
00:07:53,681 --> 00:07:55,600
YOU KNOW, THANKS FOR
TRYING TO CHEER ME UP

195
00:07:55,600 --> 00:07:56,851
BUT I'M NOT GOING TO DATE

196
00:07:56,851 --> 00:07:58,312
SOME RANDOM GUY
FROM YOUR WORK.

197
00:07:58,312 --> 00:08:01,106
NOT RANDOM. BOB.

198
00:08:01,106 --> 00:08:04,318
OH... IT'S PROBABLY BECAUSE
I'M NOT MATURE ENOUGH

199
00:08:04,318 --> 00:08:06,361
OR SMART ENOUGH, OR...

200
00:08:06,361 --> 00:08:08,029
MAYBE HE DOESN'T LIKE
THE WAY I DRESS.

201
00:08:08,029 --> 00:08:10,324
NO, THAT CAN'T BE IT.

202
00:08:10,324 --> 00:08:11,908
IT'S REALLY GOT TO BE
THE SMART THING.

203
00:08:11,908 --> 00:08:13,910
OH, I'M
SO STUPID.

204
00:08:13,910 --> 00:08:17,372
I'M JUST THIS, LIKE,
INCREDIBLY PRETTY, STUPID GIRL.

205
00:08:17,372 --> 00:08:19,624
NO, HONEY...

206
00:08:19,624 --> 00:08:22,961
OKAY. OKAY.
DO YOU WANT TO KNOW

207
00:08:22,961 --> 00:08:25,964
WHY ROSS CANCELED
THE DATE?

208
00:08:25,964 --> 00:08:28,258
BECAUSE I ASKED HIM TO.

209
00:08:28,258 --> 00:08:30,385
YOU ASKED HIM TO?
MM-HMM.

210
00:08:30,385 --> 00:08:31,428
WHY?

211
00:08:31,428 --> 00:08:32,929
BECAUSE YOU ARE MY SISTER

212
00:08:32,929 --> 00:08:36,641
AND ROSS AND I HAVE
THIS HUGE HISTORY...

213
00:08:36,641 --> 00:08:38,310
I DON'T UNDERSTAND.
YOU WANT TO GO OUT WITH ROSS?

214
00:08:38,310 --> 00:08:39,436
NO.

215
00:08:39,436 --> 00:08:40,479
YOU DON'T WANT HIM, BUT YOU

216
00:08:40,479 --> 00:08:41,729
DON'T WANT ME TO HAVE HIM?

217
00:08:41,729 --> 00:08:45,566
YOU KNOW BOB
IN HUMAN RESOURCES?

218
00:08:45,566 --> 00:08:47,444
OH! I CANNOT BELIEVE
YOU DID THIS TO ME!

219
00:08:47,444 --> 00:08:48,778
YOU HAD ME DOUBTING
HOW SMART I WAS...

220
00:08:48,778 --> 00:08:50,155
( gasps )

221
00:08:50,155 --> 00:08:52,782
YOU HAD ME DOUBTING
MY FASHION SENSE.

222
00:08:52,782 --> 00:08:54,034
COME ON! THIS IS NOT
THAT BIG A DEAL.

223
00:08:54,034 --> 00:08:55,452
YOU JUST DON'T DATE ROSS.

224
00:08:55,452 --> 00:08:56,953
THERE'S A MILLION
OTHER GUYS OUT THERE.

225
00:08:56,953 --> 00:08:59,706
HEY-- YOU HAVE NO RIGHT
TO TELL ME WHAT TO DO.

226
00:08:59,706 --> 00:09:01,208
I'M NOT TELLING YOU
WHAT TO DO.

227
00:09:01,208 --> 00:09:04,503
I AM TELLING YOU
WHAT NOT TO DO.

228
00:09:04,503 --> 00:09:06,587
WHY ARE YOU ALWAYS
SO JEALOUS OF ME?

229
00:09:06,587 --> 00:09:09,090
OH, JILL, THIS IS NOT ABOUT
ME BEING JEALOUS OF YOU.

230
00:09:09,090 --> 00:09:10,633
THIS IS ABOUT YOU
BEING A BRAT--

231
00:09:10,633 --> 00:09:11,926
WANTING WHAT YOU CAN'T HAVE.

232
00:09:11,926 --> 00:09:13,594
"CAN'T HAVE"?

233
00:09:13,594 --> 00:09:16,806
EXCUSE ME. THE ONLY THING
I CAN'T HAVE IS DAIRY!

234
00:09:18,558 --> 00:09:20,268
ALL RIGHT, ALL RIGHT.

235
00:09:20,268 --> 00:09:22,979
WELL, YOU JUST BLEW
