478
00:19:41,097 --> 00:19:42,431
YOU JUST DON'T KISS THEM.

479
00:19:42,431 --> 00:19:44,642
SEE, LOOK AT US
RIGHT NOW, NOT KISSING.

480
00:19:44,642 --> 00:19:47,311
LET ME FINISH, OKAY?

481
00:19:47,311 --> 00:19:50,272
SHE STARTED KISSING
ME, AND I...

482
00:19:50,272 --> 00:19:51,607
DIDN'T STOP IT.

483
00:19:51,607 --> 00:19:53,275
I GUESS I JUST
WASN'T THINKING.

484
00:19:53,275 --> 00:19:55,444
YEAH, THAT'S RIGHT,
YOU WEREN'T THINKING.

485
00:19:55,444 --> 00:19:57,237
I'LL GIVE YOU SOMETHING
TO THINK ABOUT.

486
00:19:57,237 --> 00:19:58,948
HOLD ON. JUST...

487
00:19:58,948 --> 00:20:02,076
BUT THEN I STARTED THINKING
AND I STOPPED THE KISSING.

488
00:20:02,076 --> 00:20:04,370
OH, WELL, THANK YOU
FOR TAKING YOUR TONGUE

489
00:20:04,370 --> 00:20:07,165
OUT OF MY SISTER'S MOUTH
LONG ENOUGH TO TELL ME THAT.

490
00:20:10,334 --> 00:20:12,419
LOOK, I REALIZED
THAT, IF ANYTHING

491
00:20:12,419 --> 00:20:14,338
WERE TO HAPPEN
WITH ME AND JILL

492
00:20:14,338 --> 00:20:16,924
THEN NOTHING COULD
EVER HAPPEN WITH US.

493
00:20:16,924 --> 00:20:19,093
WHAT?

494
00:20:19,093 --> 00:20:20,594
NO, I MEAN...

495
00:20:20,594 --> 00:20:22,221
LOOK, I DON'T KNOW IF ANYTHING

496
00:20:22,221 --> 00:20:24,098
IS EVER GOING
TO HAPPEN WITH US...

497
00:20:24,098 --> 00:20:27,226
AGAIN EVER.

498
00:20:27,226 --> 00:20:29,687
BUT I DON'T WANT TO KNOW
THAT IT NEVER COULD.

499
00:20:29,687 --> 00:20:31,856
SO I STOPPED IT.

500
00:20:31,856 --> 00:20:34,025
AND...

501
00:20:34,025 --> 00:20:36,069
SHE GOT MAD AND
BROKE MY PROJECTOR.

502
00:20:43,910 --> 00:20:44,869
WOW.

503
00:20:46,746 --> 00:20:49,582
I-I DON'T EVEN KNOW
WHAT TO SAY.

504
00:20:54,003 --> 00:20:55,129
THANK YOU.

505
00:20:57,631 --> 00:20:58,841
YOU'RE WELCOME.

506
00:21:00,300 --> 00:21:04,013
( sobbing )

507
00:21:05,890 --> 00:21:08,392
OH, MY GOD,
ARE YOU CRYING?

508
00:21:08,392 --> 00:21:11,938
I JUST DON'T SEE WHY THOSE TWO
CAN'T WORK THINGS OUT.

509
00:21:16,609 --> 00:21:18,694
ALL RIGHT, I'M LEAVING.

510
00:21:18,694 --> 00:21:20,362
BECAUSE I'M NOT GONNA
SPEND ONE MORE DAY WITH SOMEONE

511
00:21:20,362 --> 00:21:22,615
WHO'S OUT TO SABOTAGE
MY EVERY MOVE.

512
00:21:22,615 --> 00:21:23,824
THAT'S YOU, RACHEL.

513
00:21:25,118 --> 00:21:26,160
YEAH, I GOT THAT.

514
00:21:26,160 --> 00:21:27,536
AND YOU...

515
00:21:27,536 --> 00:21:28,829
I THROW MYSELF
AT YOU

516
00:21:28,829 --> 00:21:29,997
AND YOU SAY NO?

517
00:21:29,997 --> 00:21:31,207
HOW GAY ARE YOU?

518
00:21:35,753 --> 00:21:38,923
YOU TAKE CARE, JILL.

519
00:21:38,923 --> 00:21:40,133
OKAY, SEE YOU.

520
00:21:40,133 --> 00:21:41,134
BYE-BYE.

521
00:21:41,134 --> 00:21:42,927
BYE.

522
00:21:42,927 --> 00:21:45,679
( sobbing ):
I CAN'T BELIEVE JILL'S GONE.

523
00:21:47,265 --> 00:21:48,891
I CAN'T HELP IT.

524
00:21:48,891 --> 00:21:50,268
I OPENED A GATE.

